WEBVTT

00:06:55.212 --> 00:07:00.334
is how to balance the doom
and the urgency with things we can do,

00:07:00.358 --> 00:07:03.184
because Greta Thunberg
and the Extinction Rebellion

00:07:03.208 --> 00:07:05.364
don't want our hope --
they want us to act.

00:07:05.388 --> 00:07:06.935
So what can we do?

00:07:07.872 --> 00:07:12.782
It's hard to imagine life
without a weather service,

00:07:12.806 --> 00:07:15.121
but before modern weather forecasting,

00:07:15.145 --> 00:07:17.196
we had no commercial air travel,

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:21.088
it was common for ships to be lost at sea,

00:07:21.112 --> 00:07:24.388
and a single storm could produce
a food shortage.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.896
Once we had radio and telegraph networks,

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:31.228
all that was necessary
to solve these problems